jobs.description:
Would you like to sign-up for our Client Account Manager Wealth Management (WM) Talent Pipeline?
Please note that this pipeline is for our future recruitment needs, not the offer for an immediate employment.

We’re regularly looking for a Client Account Manager, Wealth Management to:
• support client advisors in delivering exceptional client service and experience;
• support client advisors in administrative, risk and legal and compliance related tasks and duties;
• manage daily business in HNW client servicing and provide high quality service;
• be the point of entry for processing client orders, e.g. stock orders, foreign exchange, loans and deposits;
• be the direct point of contact for daily banking activities and administrative work for our clients;
• manage daily client transactions and carry out inquiries and troubleshooting;
• perform account maintenance tasks and client-related processes; e.g. account opening and closing, suitability reviews, initial and recurring KYC and due diligence;
• support client advisors when they are on business trips and assist in preparing client meeting.

